   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation Campus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Innovation Campus Project aims to enable the next-generation labour force to work with future-shaping technologies, provide young people with the technical skills they need to thrive in and lead the 4th Industrial Revolution, and accelerate T&#xfc;rkiye&#x2019;s digital transformation by addressing the skills gap. On 6 February 2023, two devastating earthquakes, measuring 7.7 and 7.6 magnitude on the Richter Scale, struck Kahramanmaras, T&#xfc;rkiye. Impacts have been felt across ten provinces in T&#xfc;rkiye and have caused catastrophic devastation, with at least 14 million people directly impacted in T&#xfc;rkiye. The programme will contribute to the training of disadvantaged young people with a priority given to the youth displaced by the earthquake , on advanced technologies (such as AI, IoT and Big Data)UNDP IICPSD&#x2019;s SDG AI Lab will support the programme by complementing Samsung&#x2019;s AI Training curriculum through bridging these technologies with SDGs. The Lab will achieve this via conducting awareness raising and training sessi</narrative>
  </description>
